  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S.-India Aviation Cooperation Program (EDTP), through American Association of Airport Executives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this RTM series, India&apos;s aviation leaders would visit U.S. aviation-related agencies and companies to discuss practices, solutions and services that can help accelerate modernization efforts in India. The RTM series is a follow-on deliverable to the key topics discussed at the U.S.-India Aviation Partnership Summit (USTDA Activity No. 2017-31012A). This funding in the amount of $27,220 is being added to a contract to provide funding for an IQC contractor to support the U.S.-India Aviation Cooperation Reverse Trade Mission Series.</narrative>
  </description>
